### gateway → order → inventory（正常）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/order/1

### 直接调 order（绕过 gateway）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/order/2

### 直接调 inventory
GET http://localhost:8082/api/inventory/SKU-1

### ---------- 故障注入 ----------

### 01 RT 飙升：order 接口慢 2s
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos/latency?ms=2000

### 02 错误率：inventory 30% 抛错
POST http://localhost:8082/chaos/error?percent=30

### 03 OOM：order 加 200MB 堆
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos/oom?mb=200

### 04 DB 慢：inventory 查询慢 1.5s
POST http://localhost:8082/chaos/db-slow?ms=1500

### 05 CPU 100%：inventory 烧 CPU 300s
POST http://localhost:8082/chaos/cpu?seconds=300

### Reset all
POST http://localhost:8080/chaos/reset
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos/reset
POST http://localhost:8082/chaos/reset

### ---------- 查看状态 ----------
GET http://localhost:8081/chaos/status
GET http://localhost:8082/chaos/status

### Prometheus reload rules
POST http://localhost:9090/-/reload
